  "source_facts": [
    "CID16217716 CAS annotations name10030-67-8 for melezitose monohydrate; its C18H34O17 formula and stereochemical InChI equal the baseline YAML.",
    "Removing the one water component from the inspected CID16217716 InChI yields CID92817/CHEBI6731 exactly. CHEBI6731 is the form parent, not the monohydrate exact identity.",
    "CHEBI183824 is anhydrous and has a different InChI stereochemical layer; do not choose it from the similar name.",
    "CultureBotHT row1142 provides monohydrate/CAS10030-67-8/FW522.5. Row1359 separately identifies generic hydrate CAS207511-10-2; shared computed chemistry does not authorize a merge."
  ],
